    Add failing Ctrl-Y yank integration regression
    
    Adds test_ctrl_y_yanks_killed_input, which types a sentinel, kills it with
    Ctrl-U and expects production-dispatched Ctrl-Y to restore it. On Linux the
    editable Delete-all-left Ctrl-Y default shadows the fixed Yank binding, so
    this test currently fails at the final input assertion.
    
